          "hideComponent": "false",
          "topMargin": "2",
          "jcr:created": "Thu Jan 18 2024 17:29:28 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<h2><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Nurse-centered&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">solutions.</span> Patient-centered&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">care.</span></span></span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">A nurse’s work is hands-on and deeply connected to patients. But the impact doesn’t stop at the bedside. Your insight shapes how care is delivered and uncovers what patients and clinicians need most. When solutions reflect that perspective, healthcare becomes better for everyone.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Each day, you bring compassion and expertise to the forefront of patient care. Your dedication motivates and inspires us to create products tailored to meet the demands you face every day. We’re here to stand alongside you, helping to enhance the care you provide and the lives you touch.</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Aug 27 2026 15:51:42 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true",
          "bottomMargin": "2"
